torage and conversion technologies, with a focus on high-performance electrodes, electrolytes and battery systems. Read more Postdoctoral Research Fellow B/C x 2 493428 Adelaide CBD Education & Training Level B Level C Fixed term - Full-time Closing at: Sep 27 2026 - 23:55 ACST College of Engineering and Information Technology Join a collaborative, multidisciplinary team applying advanced analytical expertise to cutting-edge research and real-world challenges, at the forefront of next-generation computing technology. Read more Clinical Academic - Senior Lecturer - School of Medicine 493209 Adelaide CBD Education & Training Level C Fixed term - Part-time Closing at: Oct 5 2026 - 23:55 ACDT College of Health Exciting Senior Lecturer role in the School of Medicine, Discipline of Paediatrics and joint appointment with the Women’s & Children’s Health Network (WCHN), within the subspecialties of gastroenterology, renal medicine or general paediatrics. Read more Data Engineer 493457 Adelaide CBD Engineering HEO7 Fixed term - Full-time Closing at: Sep 13 2026 - 23:55 ACST Corporate Enable data-driven decision-making by designing, developing, and maintaining robust data pipelines, models, and solutions. Read more Science Communication Specialist (GeoEnergy) 493251 Adelaide CBD HEO7 Fixed term - Full-time Closing at: Sep 7 2026 - 23:55 ACST College of Science Deliver engaging science communication and outreach initiatives that connect Earth science, engineering and GeoEnergy research with schools and the community. Read more Teaching Casuals (AU Online) – 2026 493313 Adelaide CBD Casual Campaign Casual Closing at: Dec 11 2026 - 23:55 ACDT Academic Do you have a passion for online teaching? Are you interested in supporting students who want to study on demand? Adelaide University Online is accepting expressions of interest for casual teaching academics who are interested in undertaking sessional teaching contracts. Read more School of Nursing and Midwifery Teaching casuals (tu